# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local development (never commit `.dev.vars`).
#
# Optional shared secret protecting the MCP endpoint.
# - Unset  -> MCP served at  /mcp            (open; fine for local dev)
# - Set    -> MCP served at  /mcp/<secret>   (unguessable URL, works with
#             claude.ai custom connectors, which accept a URL but no headers)
#
# In production set it with:  npx wrangler secret put MCP_SECRET
MCP_SECRET=
